# Llama Man release signing key — NEXT (DESIGN section 12.1 step 3).
#
# The binary embeds a current key AND a "next" key so a rotation needs no flag
# day: a release signed with either verifies, so the new key can ship in a
# release that is still signed with the old one, and the old key is retired a
# release later once every host that will ever update has the new one compiled
# in.
#
# Like the current key, this placeholder was generated with its private half
# discarded. See release-current.pub.
ceUGqgBjUCgpPijhXgxtBpQOUN46y4VtYfwt3QZMPZk=
